# Build context exclusions — keep Docker build context lean.
# Without this, `COPY . .` ships the entire repo incl. .git (1.3GB+) and
# every apps/* folder, blowing past the available overlay space.
#
# The Dockerfile only needs: pnpm-workspace.yaml, package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml,
# tsconfig.base.json, packages/, and apps/dra-gabriela/. Everything below can go.

**/.git
**/.git/**
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# Per-app build artifacts
apps/**/.next
apps/**/.turbo
apps/**/out
apps/**/coverage

# Logs / scratch
**/*.log
**/tmp/
**/.cache/

# Editor / OS
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Test artifacts not needed for production build
**/tests/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/playwright/.cache

# Docs and meta — keep README.md but drop scratchpad files
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/scratch.md
**/scratchpad.md
